sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Navegador
    participant W as web-ssr BFF
    participant G as gateway Nginx
    participant A as auth-api
    participant D as user-db
    participant X as Atacante
    U->>W: Login
    W->>G: POST /api/auth/login
    G->>A: POST /auth/login
    A->>D: INSERT hash refresh + family_id
    A-->>G: Access JWT (<=15min) + refresh
    G-->>W: Tokens
    W-->>U: Cookies HttpOnly (cb_session, cb_refresh)
    U->>W: GET privado casi al vencer JWT
    W->>G: POST /api/auth/refresh
    G->>A: POST /auth/refresh
    A->>D: SELECT refresh FOR UPDATE + rotación
    A-->>W: Nuevos tokens (vía gateway)
    X->>G: Reutiliza refresh anterior
    G->>A: Replay /auth/refresh
    A->>D: Revoca toda la familia
    A-->>X: HTTP 401 (vía gateway)
